WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.860
I learned Kung-Fu from the janitor at my middle school.

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.850
I'm Henry Goldman, and I believe in America.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:27.040
So they have a cheaper higher education, universal health care... If you think about it, Canada's actually better than America.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.900
I'll tell you another thing, Soccer is my favorite sport!

